1206	1299	1199	1199	He	24	“ You ARE acute . Yes , she was in love . That is , she had been . That came out -- she could n’t tell her story without its coming out . I saw it , and she saw I saw it ; but neither of us spoke of it . I remember the time and the place -- the corner of the lawn , the shade of the great beeches and the long , hot summer afternoon . It was n’t a scene for a shudder ; but oh-- ! ”
